.claude/notifications.json

# Backend body-contract working docs. These describe the shop-product create/update
# request contract by reading BACKEND SOURCE, and record unpatched backend defects
# (boutique ownership not checked, client-controllable `id` on create, no barcode
# uniqueness on update, approval-queue bypass) with exact backend file:line
# citations. THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC — committing them would publish a working
# exploitation guide for a live system. Keep them local; share via the backend
# team's own channel, never via this repo.
docs/api-requirements/shop-product-body-contract.md
docs/api-requirements/shop-product-body-payloads.txt
docs/api-requirements/seller-product-body-alignment-roadmap.md
Guest-Authentication-&-Token-Renewal.md
